# Next.js / TypeScript

- Static export only — no API routes, no server runtime features
- Server components by default; `"use client"` only when required
- Read markdown from `content/` at build time via `fs` in server components
- Do not import `fs`-using modules in client components
- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run build` before claiming done
- Match existing file structure: pages in `src/app/`, shared code in `src/lib/` and `src/components/`
